Upstream: open umbrella issue gfx-rs/wgpu#7687 (by 0x64617061, 2025-05-12) lists glsl_parser panics in proc/constant_evaluator.rs and front/mod.rs for malformed constructors, which may overlap this patch. No fix yet.

The const_assert hunks (NonConst condition such as `const_assert ~~vec2();` hit unreachable!) were dropped at the 11-24 bump: upstream fixed them identically in 3d2deb9d9 (gfx-rs/wgpu#10897). The remaining fixes are not fixed upstream as of 1edb79d1.

